<description>&lt;p&gt;The U.S. military is now assisting Ecuador in its first land operation against cartels, bringing foreign forces into the internal security fight. An attack on a fishing vessel off Ecuador’s coast killed multiple people, extending violence to the maritime domain. These actions show the crisis expanding beyond urban clashes to external involvement and seaward attacks. The only cited historical metric remains two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPajZUbGM0RmUtdjZzdzRFSmhBQ3dsc3k2bXlwYndqd2FJc2JDZjhBMFE5di1FUFR1NTRRLTZiZzZsM0tsN1BJQ3JzV01LbFdDbWduMnNENDB5QmZkODRzbWVxTWF3cF9ucU5vZmpjbjJULWltMWpIVWxBTzFWRWlxeQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQN0tJdF9WVHY4aFhPcnNuTzFmTXV0T2hRSlp6SDF5bVBicFRuQTNGYllpbHVrN2hXMU92OGpRd01PNU9oWjJtZUVjdVM2OWpRc2ZjX2NKUUI2SjR3eDJzMU1YMXNzampqbTNtVVVLVU1xb3pqcFdBRk5maDdnb2F3Y3FDNW9ZMVhnVHdnUVhwWllpdjEzRjYxN1JiQzh6VHpNZUh4MndaWGFYbVJWbHoxVmt4S1dOUHM4MEZ1WGpmUWpCQzRnSXRpckZFNUJXZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Stuff&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOQk1GRDFXcmo5RGltNEt2QlJvcDBoOWdZUnpiNkExd3lvWlBweTdBaThuM0ZqZ2lUaldndk5SMFlIWTVyQWlaZThwT0NoV2pQcDJoV2QzMV80QnA0NmlmTldRMzFkSlQ1cjlzdGk4bzlXeXE1MTAxMWt6bEZaN2p0aWE4cm1qQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Chosunbiz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPS0FEVERUTVcwVFd4NUNKX2dRRzNzQXhfQUlNX2JDRW9zeWsyeU93ZVl5XzJ1a3BJbUtZQ1N2SjVPLTVlN0pfZUw4OFVWRWptM2VuNVYtSV9wbm5ELW5hdEtZdWNDclZwLTFFSmlLeUNrY3RnVk9KdkJfNFdkbmxZS0lMVXdpZWVROE9ob3VQY0E2UDJyVjhoekRlN3ljWHVseVNCNklFLUlVYm_SAbABQVVfeXFMUEVoWXJOeGhaM1FGMWZf